 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [0.4.0] - 2026-10-22
+
+### Added
+
+- **Automatic tool input validation.** `ToolRegistry.execute` now validates tool input against
+  the registered `inputSchema` using Ajv before the executor runs. Validation failures are
+  returned to the model as a `tool_result` message, allowing it to correct the call and retry
+  within the existing tool-round budget.
+- Static tool schemas are compiled once at `register` time; function-valued tool definitions
+  have their schemas compiled on each call and cached by schema object reference.
+- `ajv` is now a runtime dependency.
+
+### Changed
+
+- **Executors can assume valid input.** Since the engine now enforces the `inputSchema`,
+  tool executors no longer need to perform manual validation or defensive casting for
+  required fields. Undeclared extra properties are still passed through unchanged if the
+  schema allows them.
+
